<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dow Chemical rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dow Chemical rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers analyst Ted Semegran initiated Dow Chemical Co as short-term buy and long-term market perform, his office said.</p>
<p>-- also initiated the following as short-term hold and long-term market perform: Union Carbide Corp, Wellman Inc, Eastman Chemical Co, IMC Global Inc, and Potash Corp of Saskatchewan.</p>
<p>-- Dow rose 1/8 to 80, Carbide was off 3/8 to 42-3/4, Wellman was unchanged at 15-1/2, Eastman fell 3/8 to 52, IMC gained 1/4 to 35-3/4, and Potash fell 1/8 to 75-1/8 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
